## How to Use This Prompt

**Option A — Claude.ai Project Instructions:**
Create a new Project in Claude, paste the entire prompt block above into the Project Instructions field. Every conversation in that project will follow these rules.

**Option B — Start of Conversation:**
Paste it at the beginning of any new chat where you're building a web page or UI.

**Option C — Custom Instructions (User Preferences):**
If you want this behavior across ALL your Claude conversations, paste a condensed version into your Claude user preferences/custom instructions.

## What This Prompt Does

1. **Forces Claude to act like a real designer** — asks questions, proposes direction, iterates
2. **Eliminates AI design tells** — no generic layouts, boring fonts, or cookie-cutter patterns
3. **Context-aware design** — different rules for landing pages vs dashboards vs e-commerce vs portals
4. **Consistent quality** — built-in design system standards, animation toolkit, responsive requirements
5. **Collaborative workflow** — Claude will ask for your brand assets, images, and preferences before building
